---
const quotes = [
  "Hoje meu surf estava travado.",
  "Não sei se estou melhorando.",
  "Não sei o que preciso treinar.",
];
---

<section id="o-problema" class="sr-section sr-light sr-problem">
  <div class="sr-glow sr-drift sr-problem-glow-a" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="sr-glow sr-drift-slow sr-problem-glow-b" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="sr-container sr-problem-inner">
    <div class="sr-problem-head">
      <p class="sr-eyebrow" data-reveal>01 · O problema</p>
      <h2 class="sr-h2 sr-problem-title" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:90ms">
        Você termina a sessão,
        <span class="sr-problem-em">mas não sabe o que precisa melhorar.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <ul class="sr-problem-quotes">
      {
        quotes.map((q, i) => (
          <li
            class="sr-quote"
            data-reveal="right"
            style={`--reveal-delay:${180 + i * 130}ms;--tilt:${i % 2 === 0 ? "-1.1deg" : "1.4deg"};--nudge:${i * 14}px`}
          >
            <span class="sr-quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span>
            <span class="sr-quote-text">{q}</span>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="sr-container sr-problem-resolve" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:120ms">
    <div class="sr-hairline"></div>
    <p class="sr-problem-answer">
      O SurfRise transforma essas sensações em uma
      <em>análise objetiva da sua sessão</em> — e mostra o que você pode trabalhar para evoluir.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .sr-problem {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-foam) 0%, #ffffff 62%, var(--color-foam) 100%);
    padding-block: clamp(6rem, 13vw, 10rem);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .sr-problem-glow-a {
    inset-block-start: -10%;
    inset-inline-start: -12%;
    width: 46vw;
    height: 46vw;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgb(79 91 245 / 0.16), transparent 68%);
  }
  .sr-problem-glow-b {
    inset-block-end: -18%;
    inset-inline-end: -10%;
    width: 40vw;
    height: 40vw;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgb(53 208 232 / 0.18), transparent 68%);
  }

  .sr-problem-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(2.75rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .sr-problem-inner {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 0.95fr);
    }
  }

  .sr-problem-title {
    margin: 1.1rem 0 0;
    max-width: 22ch;
  }
  .sr-problem-em {
    display: block;
    background: linear-gradient(96deg, var(--color-brand-deep), var(--color-brand) 45%, var(--color-teal));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .sr-problem-quotes {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .sr-quote {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-inline-start: var(--nudge);
    padding: 1.15rem 1.5rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 22px 22px 22px 6px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid rgb(10 16 32 / 0.1);
    box-shadow:
      0 2px 6px rgb(10 16 32 / 0.08),
      0 22px 44px -26px rgb(10 16 32 / 0.55);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 1.8vw, 1.3125rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    rotate: var(--tilt);
    transition: rotate 0.7s var(--ease-fluid), transform 0.7s var(--ease-fluid);
  }
  .sr-quote:hover {
    rotate: 0deg;
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }
  .sr-quote-mark {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    line-height: 0.7;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-brand) 42%, transparent);
    translate: 0 0.18em;
  }
  .sr-quote-text {
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .sr-problem-resolve {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    margin-top: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }
  .sr-problem-answer {
    margin: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.75rem) 0 0;
    max-width: 46rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.6vw, 1.875rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .sr-problem-answer em {
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 800;
    background: linear-gradient(96deg, var(--color-brand), var(--color-teal));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }
</style>
